# Phase 6 Walkthrough: Neo-Bank UI & Distributed Architecture

I have successfully executed the massive design overhaul and architecture scaffolding for Phase 6!

## ⚙️ 1. Backend Architecture Scaffolding
The distributed **Saga Architecture** has been laid out. I have scaffolded the following Spring Boot microservices:
- **`payment-service`**: Handles Stripe and local wallet logic.
- **`review-service`**: Handles 5-star ratings and feedback metrics.
- **`saga-orchestrator`**: Coordinates distributed transactions (like loans) across services.

## 🎨 2. React UI Redesign: The Neo-Bank Aesthetic
As requested, I completely redesigned the React web application to match the modern, sleek aesthetic of leading Neo-Banks like **Revolut**, **IND Money**, and **Robinhood**. 
The app now features a gorgeous Dark Mode with vibrant primary accents, rounded cards, and bold typography.

### 🏦 Portfolio & Payment Gateways
The Portfolio dashboard now prominently features the 30% / 70% loan credit split. It also introduces the new **Payment Gateway Integrations** allowing users to connect Stripe or Local Wallets (Paytm, PhonePe) to top-up their accounts or receive payouts!

