### 📈 Smartsheet Financial Planner
I implemented a grid-based "Smartsheet" style financial planner that allows users to track their Cashflow vs. Budgets with clear variance and status badges.

![Smartsheet Financial Planner](file:///Users/muneeb/.gemini/antigravity/brain/dfb66f55-2ce1-488f-8b56-b8267c6b143a/react_neobank_planning_1777636444007.webp)

### 🌐 Omnichannel Settings
The new Settings dashboard introduces toggles for users to opt-in to their preferred communication channels: **WhatsApp Business**, **X (Twitter) DM**, **Instagram/Snapchat**, and **Email**.

